# 💬 OPIc Expression - Day31

## Today's Expression

### What I like most about it is...

Meaning:

제가 그것에 대해 가장 좋아하는 점은 ~예요.

---

## When to Use

어떤 장소, 활동, 물건, 서비스 등에 대해
자신의 의견과 이유를 구체적으로 설명할 때 사용한다.

단순히

"I like it because it's good."

이라고 말하는 것보다 훨씬 자연스럽게
이유를 확장할 수 있다.

---

## Examples

What I like most about it is the atmosphere.

What I like most about the place is its convenient location.

What I like most about this hobby is that it helps me relax.

---

## Useful Patterns

### What I like most about it is + 명사

What I like most about it is the atmosphere.

---

### What I like most about it is that + 문장

What I like most about it is that I can relax.

---

## Answer Expansion

I like...

↓

What I like most about it is...

↓

The main reason is that...

↓

For example,...

↓

That's why...

